<title>NEW ZEALAND: Franklin holds 6.47 pct Tranz Rail stake.</title>
<headline>Franklin holds 6.47 pct Tranz Rail stake.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Resources Inc became a substantial security holder in Tranz Rail Holdings on March 13, with a relevant interest in 6.47 percent of its voting securities, Tranz Rail said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said all shares were purchased as American Depository Receipts (ADRs) and the underlying shares are held by The Bank of New York.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
